Description: ucc-rusted (Uniwill Control Center)
 ucc-rusted is a Rust-backed system control application suite for Uniwill
 (TUXEDO, XMG, Mechrevo, Clevo) laptops. Includes the Rust system daemon,
 graphical Qt6 interface, command-line tool, session agent, and SNI tray.
 .
 Features:
  - Fan control management
  - Keyboard backlight control
  - Display settings
  - CPU power management
  - Water cooler monitoring and control
  - System monitoring
  - System tray integration
